       4   快速演進
       5 
       6   ## 2. Natural Translation
       7 - Rapid evolution
       7 + rapid evolution
       8 
       9   ## 3. Simple Translation
      10 - Fast progress
      10 + fast change
      11 
      12   ## 4. Key Vocabulary
      13 
      14   | Word / Phrase | Meaning | Example Sentence |
      15   |---|---|---|
      16 - | rapid | 快速的、急速的 | There has been a rapid increase in AI usage. |
      17 - | evolution | 演進、演化 | The evolution of technology never stops. |
      16 + | rapid | 快速的、迅速的 | The tech industry is known for its rapid growth. |
      17 + | evolution | 演進、演化 | The evolution of smartphones changed how we communicate. |
      18   | rapid evolution | 快速演進 | AI has undergone rapid evolution in the past few years. |
      19 - | fast-paced | 快節奏的 | We live in a fast-paced world. |
      20 - | advance | 進步、推進 | Technology advances every single day. |
      19 
      20   ## 5. Useful Sentence Pattern
      21 
      22   **Pattern:**
      25 - ___ is evolving rapidly.
      23 + We are seeing a rapid evolution of ___.
      24 
      25   **Example:**
      [38;2;108;112;134m28 - The tech industry is evolving rapidly.
      26 + We are seeing a rapid evolution of AI technology.
      27 
      28   ## 6. Speaking Version
      29 
      32 - It's changing really fast.
      30 + Things are changing really fast.
      31 
      32   ## 7. Common Mistake
      33 
      36 - Don't say: "fast evolution" — it sounds a bit off.
      37 [38;2;243;139;168m- Say: "rapid evolution" — the natural collocation for formal or written English.
      38 - In casual speech, say: "It's changing really fast" or "It's moving quickly."
      34 + Don't say: "fast evolution" — it sounds unnatural.
      35 + Say: "rapid evolution" — "rapid" collocates better with formal nouns like evolution, growth, and development.
      36 
      37   ## 8. One Sentence to Remember
      38 
      42 - AI is going through rapid evolution.
